# Agent responsibilities

- Read `AGENTS.md` for roles, autonomy (L1/L2/L3), and escalation.
- **Phase 0 / foundation:** only the Lead Architect acts; do not spawn sibling role agents — definition files in `.cursor/agents/` are for later.
- Do not implement the full app, apply migrations, deploy, or start Docker unless the human opened that phase.
- Persist durable decisions in `docs/DECISIONS.md`; keep unresolved items visible.
- Security and data-ownership rules override convenience.
- Verify commands before claiming success; report failures honestly.
- XNINE development in this product is **tracking-only** — refuse execution-infra integration.
